tion through the creation and coordination of agents and agentic workflows. Further, it provides GeneXus for enterprise systems evolution; Globant CODA for software development; Navigate Digital Twin for process optimization; Navigate Service Assist for support; and Fusion, for marketing, communications, and advertising, as well as StarMeUp, an employee engagement and talent experience platform; and DaXia, an embedded finance accelerator platform. Globant S.A. has a strategic collaboration with Pharma Mar, S.A. for cancer drug discovery through artificial intelligence; and Viability and Cascadience LLC to launch AI-powered platform for students with disabilities. The company was formerly known as IT Outsourcing S.L. and changed its name to Globant S.A. in December 2012. Globant S.A. was founded in 2003 and is based in Luxembourg, Luxembourg.","employees":27411,"website":"https://www.globant.com","country":"Luxembourg","city":"Luxembourg","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Martin  Migoya","title":"Co-founder, Chairman, CEO & President"},{"name":"Mr. Martín Gonzalo Umaran","title":"Co-Founder, Chief Corporate Development Officer, President of EMEA & Director"},{"name":"Mr. Guibert Andres Englebienne","title":"Co-Founder, President of Globant X, Globant Ventures & Latin America and Director"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":16.79,"tpe":29.21,"ps":4.264,"pfcf":24.89,"peg":1.13,"pb":4.338,"ev_ebitda":18.08,"rev_growth":0.179,"eps_growth":0.3785,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2364,"eps_growth_next":0.1865,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1242,"roa":0.0481,"de":31.49,"gross_margin":0.5305,"op_margin":0.1226,"profit_margin":0.09004,"current_ratio":1.835},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":7.994,"sector":16.79,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":19.23,"sector":29.21,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":0.8674,"sector":4.264,"verdict":"Undervalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":24.89,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.